{
  "name": "Flash Edge Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have two [One-Handed] melee weapons equipped. You gain the [Dual Wield] condition, and your [Attack Power] becomes [Both Weapons' (Attack Power) combined].</p>\n<p>(SR 2): When [Pursuit] is activated by your [Melee Attack], give [Target: Single unit / Range: 2 Sq] as a secondary target and deal direct damge equal to one stack of [Pursuit] that was triggered.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style in which two weapons are manipulated at a flashing speed and a series of attacks are fired.</p>",
